        "ref": "dsn_a90ae72bea48ce174a5e812d",
        "quotedText": "4 By entering into this Data Processing Agreement, Administrator instructs Alaio to process Personal Data only in accordance with applicable law: (a) to provide the Processor Services and any related technical support; (b) as further specified via Administrator´s use of the Processor Services (including in the settings and other functionality of the Processor Services) and any related technical support; (c) as documented in this Data Processing Agreement; and (d) as further documented in any other written instructions given by Administrator and acknowledged by Bitrix24 as constituting instructions for purposes of this Data Processing Agreement.",
