        "ref": "dsn_f59f12d66a1e4512b0501b39",
        "quotedText": "(e) Administrator shall, in its use or receipt of the Services, Process Personal Data in accordance with the requirements of Data Protection Legislation and will ensure that its instructions for the Processing of Personal Data shall comply with Data Protection Legislation. Administrator shall have sole responsibility for the accuracy, quality, and legality of Personal Data and the means by which Administrator acquired Personal Data. Alaio will inform the Administrator immediately if it believes that a data processing instruction violates the GDPR or other data protection provisions of the Union or the Member States.",
